{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "New Interests and Aspirations", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Vanessa and Life Coaching", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": " Understand detailed descriptions of real or imaginary events and experiences in present, past or future and in spoken or written texts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Future Time Clauses: if, When", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use  <span class=\"strong\">time clauses</span> to give information about time and sequence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the words <span class=\"italic\">If </span>or  <span class=\"italic\">When </span>to give an information about a sequence of events in the future. <span class=\"strong\">Future time clauses</span> explain what needs to happen or which condition needs to be satisfied before a future event can occur.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">first conditional</span> with these <span class=\"strong\">time clauses</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure: <br/> If/When+ Subject + Simple Present tense, Subject + will/be going to + Simple Present tense", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">If </span>means on the condition that ...", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">If</span> I go home early, I will watch a movie.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">When </span>means at the time of doing something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">When</span> I finish my work, I will leave.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">If</span> you can commit to being here for five sessions, you will reach a level of contentment by learning techniques to facilitate.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">When</span> I finish this course, I feel that positive change will be possible.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Future Continuous Tense: Will  and Going to", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the Future Continuous tense to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I will be working at 4 p.m. tomorrow. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " There are two ways to use the Future Continuous tense:</br/></br/><ul> <li>You can use the Future Continuous to indicate that a longer action in the future will be interrupted by a shorter action in the future. </li></ul> Structure: will + be + present participle of the verb or am/is/are + going to be + present participle of the verb. </li></ul> Structure: <br>will + be + present participle of the verb<br>or<br> am/is/are + going to be + present participle of the verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">We<span class=\"strong\"> will be doing </span>exercises on discovering your inner strength, and that discovery will lead to true success.<br>They<span class=\"strong\"> will be studying </span>Philosophy until the end of the semester.<br> I <span class=\"strong\">am going to be working</span> on the second floor when you come to get me tonight.<br><span class=\"strong\">Are you going to leave</span>  for the party as soon as he calls?", "type": "text"}, {"content": " I am going to to give you the tools to make your life fuller and more rewarding. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "With five sessions you are going to expand your potential, reduce stress, and learn to sustain your successes.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rewarding", "type": "name"}, {"content": "satisfying", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am going to give you the tools to make your life fuller and more rewarding.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about self-improvement.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to expand", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to grow larger", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: With five sessions you are going to expand your potential, reduce stress and learn to sustain your success.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "essentially", "type": "name"}, {"content": "basically", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Essentially, there is no magic here. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "contentment", "type": "name"}, {"content": "satisfaction", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you can commit to being here for five sessions, you will reach a level of contentment.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "peace of mind", "type": "name"}, {"content": "mental calm ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We teach learning techniques to facilitate relaxation and peace of mind.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hold oneself back", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to stop oneself from doing something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Furthermore, I always feel I am holding myself back from doing my best. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le04ob01aud06", "type": 